Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:33:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0985/3799] soh: rename func_800C170C ->
 PreRender_CopyImageTintedImpl

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: tiled blit from fbuf into fbufSave, differing from PreRender_CopyImage in that it runs in G_CYC_1CYCLE with a combiner that modulates the texel by the env colour rather than in copy mode; the r/g/b/a arguments are that env colour. Only its white-passing wrapper calls it, so "tinted" describes the capability, not any observed use.
Defined in soh/src/code/PreRender.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h  | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/PreRender.c | 5 +++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

